[[Memory of Battle|Memories of Battle]] are [[crafting material]]s used to craft legendary components to create [[precursor weapon]]s. They are available from WvW reward tracks and can be purchased on the trading post.

== Acquisition ==
* [[WvW Reward Track]] (usually the 2nd reward (5) and the 22nd reward (10) for a total of 15 per track)
** The [[Gift of Battle Item Reward Track]] gives 25 and [[Guildrider Warclaw Skin Reward Track]] gives 50.
** [[Dragon Bash Reward Track]], [[Halloween Reward Track]], and [[Festival of the Four Winds Reward Track]] only give 10 each.
* List of all reward tracks containing [[Memory of Battle|Memories of Battle]] can be found [[/Reward tracks|here]].

